196
00:32:28,827 --> 00:32:54,088
[Dr. Richard Machesky] But yeah, the intention would be to have space, adequate space built into our facilities as we complete renovations moving forward. Athens, moving into the renovation at the end of the bond at Troy High, work that we're doing at Boland and Larson and so forth. But in the short term, we recognize, uh, in cooperation with the Robotics Foundation, that we need to have enough space immediately so that they can continue their good work.

