203
00:33:49,837 --> 00:33:52,341
[Vital Anne (President)] Okay, so the first year we're going to use that money, correct?

204
00:33:52,341 --> 00:33:59,884
[Dan Trudel] Yeah, and then we can circle back as a board in the spring and assess if we want to do that for another year, depending on our finances at that time.

205
00:33:59,884 --> 00:34:08,551
[Vital Anne (President)] The reason I ask is because general fund money is super important right now, so we're trying to see how to best use other funds for this.

206
00:34:08,551 --> 00:34:26,549
[Dan Trudel] So, yep, this felt like an appropriate use of those dollars. Just, it's not often you have to find a robotics space, so given that those dollars are sitting there, it helps buy us some time. You know, by not having to charge into the general fund next year, but then also look longer term at internally, do we have bond dollars that could support some type of project?

