00:44:12,807 --> 00:44:29,289
[Vital Anne (President)] Yeah, so now that we have our teacher retirements finalized and we have those numbers, and there are a lot of things that were moving parts in that $12 million reduction, right? So do we have a little more solidification on that that you can share?

