00:44:29,289 --> 00:44:48,867
[Dan Trudel] Yeah, so we, we had budgeted as part of that $12 million, we said there would be $1.5 million in savings from the buyout if we rehired everybody. So that number, because that number was based off of around 50 being fully replaced and taking it, our number came in just over 100.

245
00:44:49,172 --> 00:44:49,316
[Ayessa Potts] Okay.

246
00:44:49,396 --> 00:44:55,010
