00:58:37,807 --> 00:58:41,413
[Dr. Richard Machesky] Keeping in mind that special ed reporting is always a year behind.

304
00:58:41,413 --> 00:58:42,230
[Vital Anne (President)] Behind.

305
00:58:42,839 --> 00:58:43,576
[Vital Anne (President)] I see. Okay.

306
00:58:43,816 --> 00:58:49,239
[Vital Anne (President)] So, so this school year, that number for special ed Cost would be around $31 million.

