00:59:55,219 --> 00:59:55,542
[Ayessa Potts] Okay.

320
00:59:55,542 --> 01:00:08,279
[Dan Trudel] And largely these 2 categories, we have been able to sustain those levels over the last couple of years with 31AA money.

